#code to plot and analyze weight at age output from individual based model of sardine generated by J. FIechter
#waa data is plotted and then turned into laa
#VBGM fit to the laa output from the IBM to estimate parameters in the historical and projections period
#the change in growth parameters is then applied to the base OM growth parameters
#author: D. Tommasi

library(ggplot2)
